PROJECT: Ethereum

Entity: Vitalik Buterin
Type: Person
Relationship: Co-founder dan penulis whitepaper Ethereum; arsitek visi awal protokol dan peneliti inti hingga saat ini terlibat dalam roadmap scaling (Danksharding, Verge, Purge, Splurge)
Period: 2013–sekarang
Exposure Type: technical-integration
Evidence: (HIGH) [Ethereum Foundation, https://ethereum.org/en/foundation/]; [Wikipedia, https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vitalik_Buterin]; [Messari, https://messari.io/asset/ethereum/profile]

